{"content":[{"id":"3cff528e","settings":{"background_background":"classic","padding":{"unit":"px","top":"50","right":"0","bottom":"50","left":"0","isLinked":false},"__globals__":{"background_color":"globals\/colors?id=408e485","background_overlay_color":"globals\/colors?id=408e485"},"background_image":{"url":"https:\/\/dolandesignhvac.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/hero-neighborhood_25.webp","id":233193,"size":"","alt":"","source":"library"},"background_position":"center center","background_repeat":"no-repeat","background_size":"cover","background_overlay_background":"classic","background_overlay_opacity":{"unit":"px","size":0.69999999999999996,"sizes":[]}},"elements":[{"id":"17887631","settings":{"content_width":"full"},"elements":[{"id":"64655b49","settings":{"title":"Plumbing Services in Louisburg, NC\n","header_size":"h1","__globals__":{"title_color":"globals\/colors?id=7f92ea2","typography_typography":"globals\/typography?id=80aa35e"}},"elements":[],"isInner":false,"widgetType":"heading","elType":"widget"},{"id":"4c80c80e","settings":{"title":"Reliable Plumbing Help for Homes and Businesses in the Louisburg Area\n","header_size":"p","__globals__":{"typography_typography":"globals\/typography?id=b279f6f","title_color":"globals\/colors?id=7f92ea2"},"title_color":"#FFFFFF"},"elements":[],"isInner":false,"widgetType":"heading","elType":"widget"},{"id":"6cd30cdc","settings":{"editor":"<p>Plumbing problems rarely stay small for long. A leaking pipe, clogged drain, broken water heater, or sudden drop in water pressure can disrupt your home or business quickly and lead to costly damage if ignored.<\/p><p>Dolan Design HVAC &amp; Plumbing provides dependable plumbing services for residential and commercial properties across Louisburg, Raleigh, Wake Forest, Zebulon, Youngsville, and nearby North Carolina communities.<\/p><p>Our team helps you understand the issue, review your options, and get the right solution without pressure.<\/p>","__globals__":{"link_color":"glo