=\"font-weight: 400;\">Your plumbing system works quietly behind the scenes until something goes wrong. When it does, you need a team that can respond quickly, diagnose accurately, and protect your property from unnecessary damage.<\/span><\/p><p><strong>Dolan Design HVAC &amp; Plumbing helps with:<\/strong><\/p>","__globals__":{"text_color":"globals\/colors?id=text"}},"elements":[],"isInner":false,"widgetType":"text-editor","elType":"widget"},{"id":"3037a320","settings":{"icon_list":[{"text":"Plumbing repairs","selected_icon":{"value":"fas fa-check-circle","library":"fa-solid"},"_id":"04366aa"},{"text":"Water heater installation and service","selected_icon":{"value":"fas fa-check-circle","library":"fa-solid"},"_id":"de29481"},{"text":"Leak detection and pipe repair","selected_icon":{"value":"fas fa-check-circle","library":"fa-solid"},"_id":"25a6d32"},{"text":"Water filtration systems","selected_icon":{"value":"fas fa-check-circle","library":"fa-solid"},"_id":"1f0d0e9"},{"text":"Preventative plumbing maintenance","selected_icon":{"value":"fas fa-check-circle","library":"fa-solid"},"_id":"112e28e"}],"__globals__":{"icon_color":"globals\/colors?id=accent","text_color":"globals\/colors?id=text"}},"elements":[],"isInner":false,"widgetType":"icon-list","elType":"widget"},{"id":"7116cbf9","settings":{"editor":"<p><strong>From minor fixture issues to larger plumbing concerns, our goal is simple: restore dependable water flow, prevent damage, and help your plumbing system work the way it should.<\/strong><\/p>"},"elements":[],"isInner":false,"widgetType":"text-editor","elType":"widget"}],"isInner":true,"elType":"container"},{"id":"47141afe","settings":{"content_width":"full","padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":true}},"elements":[{"id":"1224a73c","settings":{"image":{"url":"https:\/\/dolandesignhvac.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/practical-plumbing-solutions.jpg","id":233149,"size":"","alt":"Practical Plumbing Solutions for Homes and Businesses","source":"library"},"image_border_radius":{"unit":"px","top":"10","right":"10","bottom":"10","left":"10","isLinked":true}},"elements":[],"isInner":false,"widgetType":"image","elType":"widget"}],"isInner":true,"elType":"container"}],"isInner":true,"elType":"container"}],"isInner":false,"elType":"container"},{"id":"6e238c3f","settings":{"flex_direction":"column","background_background":"classic","background_color":"#F8F8FB","padding":{"unit":"px","top":"30","right":"0","bottom":"30","left":"0","isLinked":false},"flex_justify_content":"center"},"elements":[{"id":"19ceca33","settings":{"content_width":"full","flex_direction":"row-reverse","flex_align_items":"center"},"elements":[{"id":"297d887d","settings":{"content_width":"full","padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":true}},"elements":[{"id":"7560ed7a","settings":{"title":"Plumbing Services That Protect Your Property\n","__globals__":{"title_color":"globals\/colors?id=be5c055","typography_typography":"globals\/typography?id=7549918"}},"elements":[],"isInner":false,"widgetType":"heading","elType":"widget"},{"id":"277c84ac","settings":{"editor":"<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Plumbing systems in Louisburg, Raleigh, Wake Forest, Zebulon, Youngsville, and surrounding North Carolina communities are made up of many connected parts. When one part is not working properly, it can affect water pressure, drainage, efficiency, comfort, and even indoor air quality if moisture damage develops.<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">That is why early attention matters. A slow leak can damage cabinets or flooring, a running toilet can waste water for weeks, and a water heater issue can turn into a leak or complete loss of hot water. Taking a full-system approach to plumbing service helps protect your property, reduce water waste, and prevent small problems from becoming larger repairs.<\/span><\/p>","__globals__":{"text_color":"globals\/colors?id=text"}},"elements":[],"isInner":false,"widgetType":"text-editor","elType":"widget"}],"isInner":true,"elType":"container"},{"id":"18adf78c","settings":{"content_width":"full","padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":true}},"elements":[{"id":"43a74c28","settings":{"image":{"url":"https:\/\/dolandesignhvac.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/plumbing-services-that-protects-your-property.jpg","id":233151,"size":"","alt":"","source":"library"},"image_border_radius":{"unit":"px","top":"10","right":"10","bottom":"10","left":"10","isLinked":true}},"elements":[],"isInner":false,"widgetType":"image","elType":"widget"}],"isInner":true,"elType":"container"}],"isInner":true,"elType":"container"}],"isInner":false,"elType":"container"},{"id":"360bb50b","settings":{"flex_direction":"column","background_background":"classic","padding":{"unit":"px","top":"30","right":"0","bottom":"30","left":"0","isLinked":false},"__globals__":{"background_color":"globals\/colors?id=7f92ea2"},"boxed_width":{"unit":"%","size":90,"sizes":[]},"boxed_width_tablet":{"unit":"%","size":"","sizes":[]},"boxed_width_mobile":{"unit":"%","size":"","sizes":[]}},"elements":[{"id":"675a48e6","settings":{"content_width":"full"},"elements":[{"id":"323c2092","settings":{"content_width":"full","flex_direction":"row-reverse","background_background":"classic","background_color":"#F8F8FB","padding":{"unit":"px","top":"30","right":"30","bottom":"30","left":"30","isLinked":true}},"elements":[{"id":"1acb3d33","settings":{"content_width":"full","padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":true}},"elements":[{"id":"7669c7b9","settings":{"selected_icon":{"value":"far fa-check-circle","library":"fa-regular"},"title_text":"Water Heater Installation & Service","description_text":"","position":"inline-start","icon_size":{"unit":"px","size":30,"sizes":[]},"__globals__":{"title_typography_typography":"globals\/typography?id=2113601","title_color":"globals\/colors?id=text",