ffects more than taste. It can also impact plumbing fixtures, appliances, laundry, dishes, skin, and overall comfort.<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">A water filtration system may help if you notice:<\/span><\/p>","__globals__":{"text_color":"globals\/colors?id=text"}},"elements":[],"isInner":false,"widgetType":"text-editor","elType":"widget"},{"id":"38dd6d2e","settings":{"icon_list":[{"text":"Unpleasant taste or odor","selected_icon":{"value":"fas fa-check-circle","library":"fa-solid"},"_id":"04366aa"},{"text":"Sediment in water","selected_icon":{"value":"fas fa-check-circle","library":"fa-solid"},"_id":"9aafa8f"},{"text":"Staining on fixtures","selected_icon":{"value":"fas fa-check-circle","library":"fa-solid"},"_id":"f5e9b44"},{"text":"Hard water concerns","selected_icon":{"value":"fas fa-check-circle","library":"fa-solid"},"_id":"1d2cbe7"},{"text":"Dry skin or hair after showering","selected_icon":{"value":"fas fa-check-circle","library":"fa-solid"},"_id":"b29c4fd"},{"text":"Frequent buildup around faucets or showerheads","selected_icon":{"value":"fas fa-check-circle","library":"fa-solid"},"_id":"6bd0c7d"}],"__globals__":{"icon_color":"globals\/colors?id=accent","text_color":"globals\/colors?id=text"}},"elements":[],"isInner":false,"widgetType":"icon-list","elType":"widget"},{"id":"22cc104f","settings":{"editor":"<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Dolan Design HVAC &amp; Plumbing can help evaluate your water quality concerns and recommend filtration options designed to improve everyday water use.<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Cleaner water can make your property feel better, protect plumbing components, and support longer appliance life.<\/span><\/p>","__globals__":{"text_color":"globals\/colors?id=text"}},"elements":[],"isInner":false,"widgetType":"text-editor","elType":"widget"}],"isInner":true,"elType":"container"}],"isInner":true,"elType":"container"}],"isInner":true,"elType":"container"}],"isInner":false,"elType":"container"},{"id":"1217e938","settings":{"flex_direction":"column"},"elements":[{"id":"a73b4d3","settings":{"content_width":"full","flex_direction":"row","flex_align_items":"center"},"elements":[{"id":"18470687","settings":{"content_width":"full"},"elements":[{"id":"6bd10619","settings":{"title":"Benefits of Regular Plumbing Maintenance\n","__globals__":{"typography_typography":"globals\/typography?id=7549918","title_color":"globals\/colors?id=408e485"}},"elements":[],"isInner":false,"widgetType":"heading","elType":"widget"},{"id":"1a19cac8","settings":{"editor":"<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Plumbing maintenance is not just about preventing emergencies. It helps you understand the condition of your system before small issues turn into expensive repairs. For both homes and businesses, routine plumbing service can protect your property, reduce water waste, and make everyday water use more reliable.<\/span><\/p>"},"elements":[],"isInner":false,"widgetType":"text-editor","elType":"widget"},{"id":"2e1a4740","settings":{"title_text":"Spot Problems Before They Interrupt Your Day","description_text":"Routine maintenance helps identify worn parts, small leaks, pressure issues, and aging fixtures before they lead to urgent service calls.\n","selected_icon":{"value":"spectrefa- spectre-fa-solid-1","library":"spectre-fontawesome"},"title_size":"h4","position":"inline-start","icon_size":{"unit":"px","size":30,"sizes":[]},"__globals__":{"title_color":"globals\/colors?id=408e485","primary_color":"globals\/colors?id=accent"}},"elements":[],"isInner":false,"widgetType":"icon-box","elType":"widget"},{"id":"7cd6190","settings":{"title_text":"Reduce Water Waste and Utility Costs","description_text":"Running toilets, dripping faucets, pressure problems, and hidden leaks can waste more water than most property owners realize. Regular inspections help catch waste early.\n","selected_icon":{"value":"spectrefa- spectre-fa-solid-2","library":"spectre-fontawesome"},"title_size":"h4","posit